  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \nTwo of the window.location update methods (window.location.replace() and window.location.href = ...) don't always restrict access to local resources. This allows an extension to load an iframe containing a local file resource, even when \"Allow access to file URLs\" is dis"
